  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/ebadc30a979bf1a7e953d20901c3e7953c575296c0e0bb4af8a458ec3a64ab2c.png] \n\nGiven statement : 459 + 17 × 12 ÷ 72 - 47 = 349 \n\nAccording to the question**, after interchanging the signs** :\n\nSo,\n\n__\n \n• Option - (1) : ÷ and +\n\n459 + 17 × 12 ÷ 72 - 47 = 349 ⇒ **459 ÷ 17**__ × 12 + 72 - 47 = 349\n\n__**27 × 12**__ + 72 - 47 = 349\n\n__**324 + 72**__ - 47 = 349 \n\n__**396 - 47**__ = 349\n\n**349 = 349 (LHS = RHS)**\n\n__\n \n• Option - (2) : ÷ and - \n\n459 + 17 × 12 ÷ 72 - 47 = 349 ⇒ 459 + 17 × 12 - **72 ÷ 47**__ = 349\n\n459 + __**17 × 12**__ - 1.53 = 349\n\n__**459 + 204**__ - 1.53 = 349\n\n__**663 - 1.53**__ = 349\n\n661.47 ≠ 349 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\n__\n \n• Option - (3) : + and ×\n\n459 + 17 × 12 ÷ 72 - 47 = 349 ⇒ 459 × 17 + **12 ÷ 72**__ - 47 = 349\n\n__**459 ×**____** 17**__ + 0.17 - 47 = 349\n\n__**7803 +**____** 0.17**__ - 47 = 349\n\n__**7803.17 - 47**__ = 349\n\n7756.17 ≠ 349 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\n__\n \n• Option - (4) : - and +\n\n459 + 17 × 12 ÷ 72 - 47 = 349 ⇒ 459 - 17 × **12 ÷ 72**__ + 47 = 349\n\n459 - __**17 × 0.17**__ + 47 = 349\n\n__**459 + 47**__ - 2.89 = 349\n\n__**506 - 2.89**__ = 349\n\n503.11 ≠ 349 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nHence, \"Option - (1)\" is the correct answer.",
